### Obtener histórico de posiciones GPS de la ejecución de una ruta — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getUnitPositionHistory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 9148507
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getUnitPositionHistory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 9148507
}

### RouteAssignmentId inválido (0) → 400 (requerido y mayor que 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getUnitPositionHistory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 0
}

### RouteAssignmentId inexistente → 400 (RAISERROR del SP) o 200 con lista vacía
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getUnitPositionHistory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 999999999
}
